    {
      "id": 120,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "GPUs free now, by type",
      "description": "Configured GPUs, minus those allocated to jobs, minus those on nodes that are down or drained. Slurm manages 57 GPUs; the DCGM panels see 67, because four hosts outside the cluster partitions also report.",
